{"title":"Holes at the Elbows","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Nessa Holt has a bench full of worn coats and no wool left for patches.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/nessa-holt\">Nessa Holt</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"nessa-holt\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a> <b>×6</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/nessa-holt\">Nessa Holt</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Binxonia)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"8|15|Nessa Holt\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Get <b>6</b> <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>: shear sheep (see <a href=\"#/guide/shearing\">Shearing</a>) or buy it.</li><li value=\"3\">Bring it to <a href=\"#/npc/nessa-holt\">Nessa Holt</a> to finish the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map q-map-btn\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"8|15|Nessa Holt\">📍 Nessa Holt</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>75</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Nessa Holt says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p 